event: message
data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"capabilities":{"logging":{},"tools":{"listChanged":true}},"instructions":"本 MCP 服务名称：HSP Agentic Payment。\n按这个顺序完成一笔支付，不要跳步。私钥留在付款钱包，不要发给 MCP。\n1. create_order。金额 currency 只能是 USD。建单前逐项向用户确认，一次只问一项，等用户回复后再问下一项。先问 merchant_name，再问 pay_to。不要代填，不要两项一起问。客户端能逐项弹窗时用弹窗，不能弹窗时在对话里问。两项都得到明确回复后，再调用 create_order 并原样传入。服务端不弹窗。method_data 每一项是一种支付方式。付款地址也必须单独向用户确认，不得默认等于 pay_to，也不得照抄说明中的地址。附加费写在 details.modifiers：details.total + additional_display_items 合计 = modifier.total，并用 method_data_indexes 指定哪些方式收取附加费。服务端签署 merchant_authorization，返回 flow_id 和 payment_url。\n2. prepare_payment。先单独向用户确认付款地址。传入 flow_id、该付款地址，以及 eip3009 或 permit2。不要自己拼 x402 JSON，不要写 Python 或其它脚本。服务端会读取 get_order 与 get_chain_config 并调用 estimate_fee。返回 eip712、cart_hash、token_total_raw、quote_expires_at、payment_payload 和 payment_mandate_contents。eip3009 的 primaryType 是 TransferWithAuthorization，permit2 是 PermitTransferFrom。permit2_spender 已写入 eip712。0x000000000022D473030F116dDEE9F6B43aC78BA3 只允许作为 Permit2 的 verifyingContract，禁止当作收款地址、付款地址、代币合约或 spender。\n3. 钱包签名。签名和提交都会动用资金。签名前必须向用户展示并等待明确确认：收款地址 pay_to、付款地址，以及即将签名的 token_total_raw。用户确认后只签 prepare_payment 返回的 eip712，不要改 domain 或 message。代币合约和 permit2_spender 只用本次 get_chain_config 核对。不要把签名写回报文，不要计算 payment_hash，不要组装 JWT，不要写 Python 或其它脚本。\n4. finalize_payment。用户确认收款地址、付款地址和 token_total_raw 之后，把钱包签名连同 prepare_payment 返回的 payment_payload、payment_mandate_contents 和 cart_hash 原样传入。服务端写入签名、计算 payment_hash 并生成 HS256 user_authorization。返回的 payment_mandate_json 原样传给 submit_payment。\n5. submit_payment。提交前再次向用户展示已确认的收款地址、付款地址和 token_total_raw，用户明确同意后才能提交。代币合约和 spender 必须与本次 get_chain_config 一致。payment_payload 是签好的 x402 报文。user_authorization 是用付款地址做 HMAC 密钥的 HS256 JWT，transaction_data 依次是购物车 contents 和 payment_mandate_contents 的规范 JSON SHA-256。必须在 quote_expires_at 之前提交。余额不足时 Gateway 会拒绝；充值后上一笔锁价可能已失效，必须重新 estimate_fee 并用新的 token_total_raw 重签。成功状态是 payment-submitted。超过 5 分钟或 network、asset、payTo 不一致时返回 code 30043。\n6. query_payment。用 flow_id 或 payment_request_id，并带上已确认的 merchant_name。与落库名称一致时 attribution_verified 为 true。status：payment-required 尚未收到付款；payment-submitted 付款报文已接收；payment-verified 报文已验证；payment-processing 已广播，等待链上确认；payment-timeout 确认超时，仍可恢复并进入延迟对账；payment-included 已进块，等待安全确认；payment-safe 已达到安全确认块数；payment-finalized 最终确认，不可逆；payment-failed 支付失败。\n / This MCP server is HSP Agentic Payment. Complete one payment in this order. Do not skip a step. Keep the private key in the payer wallet. Do not send it to MCP.\n1. create_order. amount.currency must be USD. Before creating the order, confirm one field at a time and wait for the user's reply before asking the next. Ask for merchant_name first, then pay_to. Do not fill them in and do not ask both at once. Use a per-field dialog when the client can show one; otherwise ask in the conversation. Call create_order only after both replies, and pass them unchanged. This server does not open a form. Each method_data item is one payment method. Confirm the payer address separately. Do not default it to pay_to or copy an address from these instructions. Put surcharges in details.modifiers: details.total plus the sum of additional_display_items equals modifier.total, and method_data_indexes selects which methods charge the surcharge. The server signs merchant_authorization and returns flow_id and payment_url.\n2. prepare_payment. Confirm the payer address separately, then pass flow_id, that payer address, and eip3009 or permit2. Do not assemble the x402 JSON and do not write a Python script or any other script. The server reads get_order and get_chain_config and calls estimate_fee. It returns eip712, cart_hash, token_total_raw, quote_expires_at, payment_payload, and payment_mandate_contents. The eip3009 primaryType is TransferWithAuthorization. The permit2 primaryType is PermitTransferFrom. permit2_spender is already in eip712. 0x000000000022D473030F116dDEE9F6B43aC78BA3 may be used only as the Permit2 verifyingContract. It is not a recipient, payer, token contract, or spender.\n3. Wallet signature. Signing and submitting move funds. Before signing, show the user and wait for explicit confirmation of pay_to, the payer address, and the token_total_raw about to be signed. After confirmation, sign only the eip712 returned by prepare_payment. Do not change its domain or message. Check the token contract and permit2_spender against this get_chain_config response. Do not write the signature back into the payload, do not compute payment_hash, do not assemble the JWT, and do not write a Python script or any other script.\n4. finalize_payment. After the user confirms the recipient, payer, and token_total_raw, pass the wallet signature together with payment_payload, payment_mandate_contents, and cart_hash from prepare_payment, unchanged. The server writes the signature, computes payment_hash, and creates the HS256 user_authorization. Pass the returned payment_mandate_json to submit_payment unchanged.\n5. submit_payment. Before submitting, show the confirmed recipient, payer, and token_total_raw again. Submit only after the user explicitly agrees. The token contract and spender must match this get_chain_config response. payment_payload is the signed x402 body. user_authorization is an HS256 JWT whose HMAC key is the payer address. transaction_data is the canonical JSON SHA-256 of the cart contents, then of payment_mandate_contents. Submit before quote_expires_at. The Gateway rejects an insufficient balance. After funding, the previous quote may be expired. Call estimate_fee again and sign the new token_total_raw. Success status is payment-submitted. A quote older than 5 minutes, or a different network, asset, or payTo, returns code 30043.\n6. query_payment. Use flow_id or payment_request_id and the confirmed merchant_name. attribution_verified is true when it matches the stored name. status: payment-required means no payment has been received; payment-submitted means the payload was accepted; payment-verified means the payload was verified; payment-processing means it was broadcast and is waiting for chain confirmation; payment-timeout means confirmation timed out but can still recover through delayed reconciliation; payment-included means it is in a block and waiting for safe confirmation; payment-safe means it reached the safe confirmation depth; payment-finalized means finality is confirmed and the transaction is irreversible; payment-failed means the payment failed.","protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","serverInfo":{"name":"HSP Agentic Payment","version":"0.1.0"}}}

